            <ATT name="Content"><![CDATA[#Wed Sep 30 08:07:56 CEST 2026
graphRagGroup=application
graphRagExtractionHints=Components are the numbered sub-sections of 'System Architecture', 'System Components', 'Building Block View', 'Logical View', 'Element Catalog', 'Architecture applicative', 'Architecture détaillée' and the boxes of layer and deployment diagrams. One value object per component of the document's main system; sub-components (Drivers, Pipelines, Data Store under 'DFE Layers') are separate components with the parent named in layer.
]]></ATT>
            <ATT name="status">1970354901745664</ATT>
          </ATTRIBUTES>
